      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Note the log message displaying Null is actually caused by:\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-bugs/p/branches-decompose-variables-to-null-in-certain-scenarios \nI believe the bug with set variable going missing to be a different problem, but it could be related, not sure.",
